  "details": "These freezes were caused by worlds using ProTV in particular. I'm unsure what other types are affected. But here's the easy reproduction steps:\n\n1. Go to a World using ProTV.\n\n2. Try to load a Stream on YouTube.\n\n3. See how hard your client freezes.\n\nThe URL my Video Player is auto-playing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D4MdHQOILdw\n\nHere's my own World where it freezes. Test it out here: \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ad9f51e8-acd5-4f73-9d35-fcd3d9029f1a\n\nOutput Logs Here:\n\nhttps://pastebin.com/u4FRR4eU \n\nhttps://pastebin.com/UrEAf2Lv \n\nhttps://pastebin.com/YYGj2HPy \n\nhttps://pastebin.com/Mh4iBVPy \n\nhttps://pastebin.com/wyGadRJh \n\nhttps://pastebin.com/a66007Jy",
